= To Whom It May Concern,

We have taken your printer. If you ever want to see it print again, you must:

+ Use only Dunder Mifflin papers for the rest of your life.
+ Publicly confess that typst is better than latex.
+ Star this repository on Github.

No compromise, no police, no John Wick.
You have 24 hours.

#align(right)[*— The Typst Fan Club*]
